@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - E Visa Processing

[*] --> CreateAccount

state "Create Account" as CreateAccount
state "Login" as Login
state "Apply for Visa" as ApplyVisa
state "View Status" as ViewStatus
state "Check Status" as CheckStatus
state "Cancel Application" as CancelApplication
state "Modify Details" as ModifyDetails
state "View Details" as ViewDetails
state "View Purpose" as ViewPurpose
state "Give Feedback" as GiveFeedback
state "Logout" as Logout

CreateAccount --> Login : Account Created

Login --> ApplyVisa : Logged In

ApplyVisa --> ViewStatus : Application Submitted, Payment Made

ViewStatus --> CheckStatus : Status Viewed

CheckStatus --> ViewStatus : Status Checked

ApplyVisa --> CancelApplication : Application Canceled

Login --> ModifyDetails : Details to be Modified

Login --> ViewDetails : Details to be Viewed

ApplyVisa --> ViewPurpose : Purpose of application to be viewed

ViewPurpose -> ApplyVisa : Document Check Complete, Visa Approved/Rejected

ViewStatus --> GiveFeedback : Feedback Provided

ModifyDetails --> Login : Modifications Saved

ViewDetails --> Login : Details Viewed

GiveFeedback --> Logout : Feedback Submitted

CheckStatus --> Logout : Status Checked

ApplyVisa --> Logout : Application Processed

Login --> Logout : Logged Out

[*] --> CreateAccount
@enduml
